<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 107 days of 1997:</p>
<p>---------------------------1997------1996----Pct Chg</p>
<p> Gasoline..................7,608.....7,567......0.5</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,584.....3,580......0.1</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............849.......924.....-8.1</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,575.....1,590.....-0.9</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,538.....4,559.....-0.5</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,155....18,221.....-0.4</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,435.....6,513.....-1.2</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,484.....6,943......7.8</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......13,758....13,761.....Unch</p>
